# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence

Provides structured design principles, visual hierarchy guidelines, and UX heuristics to build premium, production-ready interfaces.

## Priority Checklist

| Priority | Category | Key Standards | Anti-Patterns to Avoid |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **1. Accessibility** | Critical | Contrast ≥ 4.5:1, visible focus rings, explicit `aria-label` on icon buttons, keyboard navigable | Removing focus outlines, icon-only buttons without labels |
| **2. Touch & Sizing** | Critical | Minimum tap target 44×44px, ≥8px spacing between interactive targets | Relying solely on mouse hover, instant 0ms state changes |
| **3. Visual Hierarchy** | High | Clear typography scale (H1 → H4), consistent baseline rhythm, intentional white space | Cluttered layouts, gray-on-gray unreadable text |
| **4. Color & Theme** | High | Curated harmonious palettes, semantic tokens (`primary`, `muted`, `accent`, `destructive`), dark mode contrast | Generic harsh primaries (#ff0000), raw hardcoded hex codes |
| **5. Layout & Responsive** | High | Mobile-first breakpoints, fluid flex/grid, zero unintentional horizontal scrolling | Fixed px container widths, breaking mobile viewport |
| **6. Micro-Interactions** | Medium | Smooth transitions (150–250ms cubic-bezier), clear active/hover/focus states | Animating expensive properties (width/height), jarring delays |
| **7. Forms & Validation** | Medium | Visible persistent labels, inline field error states, instant feedback | Placeholder-only inputs, hiding error details at page top |

## Implementation Rules (Next.js & Tailwind CSS)

1. **Semantic Color Tokens**:
   - Use CSS variables / semantic theme tokens (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `border-border`, `text-muted-foreground`).
2. **Typography Scale**:
   - Base text `text-base` (16px) with `leading-relaxed` (1.5–1.625) for body copy.
   - Headings using `tracking-tight` and distinct weights (`font-semibold` / `font-bold`).
3. **Interactive Components**:
   - All interactive elements must have defined `:hover`, `:focus-visible`, and `:active` styles.
   - Ensure proper loading skeletons or disabled states for pending actions.
